  "root_cause": "rpmlint classifies C/C++/header files and a dependency on Python development headers by the package name suffix. Cython is itself a compiler and ships these files as runtime code-generation templates and debugger fixtures; its source translation/build features require Python development headers. openSUSE Factory already carries corresponding Cython filters.",
